## Interface: 16001
## Title: Pocket Essentials
## Author: ChrisMiho
## X-License: GPL-3.0
## X-Website: https://github.com/ChrisMiho/wow-forever-pocket-essentials
## Notes: Handheld-friendly helpers for WoW Forever: quest icons, a quest arrow, a bag sorter, auto sell junk and repair, chat from the round button, a menu background and loot sparkles. Each feature has its own on/off switch and starts off; a setup guide explains them.
